  "finding": "Persistent Copy-Item failure reaches actual outercatch and additive recovery-failure receipt, but original files remain writable: readonly flags are set only after successful copy; failure seal and original closure also remain writable.",
  "repair": "Separate failed-original sealing from recovery copy. After all permitted failure/closure writes, unconditionally hash and mark all original regular files readonly in a final failure/sealing path independent of Copy-Item success. Seal readonly/partial recovery status additively without modifying immutable original receipts; assert complete file coverage and mark already copied recovered files readonly. Add pure persistent-copy/partial-copy controls verifying every failed original readonly, error preserved and no recovered-success overclaim. Preserve frozen v1.0.1 and this counterexample; freeze additive repaired tool/sourceversion/manifest/newrun for re-review.",
  "scope": "Guard/failure-evidence repair only; source/oracle/delta remains compatible; no native permission."
}
